<title>USA: IMM currency futures close mostly lower.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures close mostly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 12 - IMM currency futures closed mostly lower, as the dollar continued to correct losses. Comments from U.S. Treasury  officials Rubin and Summers pressured currencies.</p>
<p>France reported progress on EU budget pact talks. Can dollars, pesos ended higher. US PPI will be released Friday at 0830 EDT/1230 GMT.</p>
